<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Evaluating permutations using the nPr formula</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><b>(a)</b> Evaluate \({}_{{@pn@}}P_{{@pr@}}\).</p>
<p>\({}_{{@pn@}}P_{{@pr@}} =\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>

<p><b>(b)</b> Evaluate \({}_{{@pn2@}}P_{{@pr2@}}\).</p>
<p>\({}_{{@pn2@}}P_{{@pr2@}} =\) [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><b>Worked Solution:</b></p>

<p>Use the permutation formula \(\displaystyle {}_nP_r = \frac{n!}{(n - r)!}\).</p>

<p><b>Part (a): Evaluating \({}_{{@pn@}}P_{{@pr@}}\)</b><br>
Substitute \(n = {@pn@}\) and \(r = {@pr@}\), expand \({@pn@}!\) until it matches \({@k1@}!\), and cancel the common factor:</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px;">\(\displaystyle {}_{{@pn@}}P_{{@pr@}} = \frac{{@pn@}!}{({@pn@} - {@pr@})!} = \frac{{@pn@}!}{{@k1@}!} = \frac{{@prod1@} \times {@k1@}!}{{@k1@}!} = {@prod1@} = {@ta1@}\)</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.2em;">\(\displaystyle \boxed{ {}_{{@pn@}}P_{{@pr@}} = {@ta1@} }\)</p>

<p><b>Part (b): Evaluating \({}_{{@pn2@}}P_{{@pr2@}}\)</b><br>
Substitute \(n = {@pn2@}\) and \(r = {@pr2@}\), expand \({@pn2@}!\) until it matches \({@k2@}!\), and cancel the common factor:</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px;">\(\displaystyle {}_{{@pn2@}}P_{{@pr2@}} = \frac{{@pn2@}!}{({@pn2@} - {@pr2@})!} = \frac{{@pn2@}!}{{@k2@}!} = \frac{{@prod2@} \times {@k2@}!}{{@k2@}!} = {@prod2@} = {@ta2@}\)</p>
<p style="margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.2em;">\(\displaystyle \boxed{ {}_{{@pn2@}}P_{{@pr2@}} = {@ta2@} }\)</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
